	"_help": [
		"Display names for applications that report an unclear name to the audio server.",
		"Left: what the app reports. It is compared, ignoring case, with the Flatpak app id,",
		"then the executable name, then the audio stream's application name. A '*' at the end",
		"matches every name starting with what comes before it.",
		"Right: the name shown on the dial, or \"@system\" to group the app under System.",
		"The plugin reloads this file a few seconds after it is saved.",
		"Run the plugin binary with --list to see the names each app reports."
